    {
      "source": "As of Spring Framework 7.0, the <code>SpringExtension</code> is\n<a href=\"#getTestInstantiationExtensionContextScope(org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.ExtensionContext)\">configured</a> to use a test-method scoped <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ExtensionContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ExtensionContext</code></a>, which\nenables consistent dependency injection into fields and constructors from the\n<a href=\"../../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> for the current test method in a\n<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/Nested.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api\"><code>@Nested</code></a> test class hierarchy. However,\nif a third-party <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.platform.launcher/org/junit/platform/launcher/TestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.platform.launcher\"><code>TestExecutionListener</code></a> is not compatible with the semantics associated with\na test-method scoped extension context — or if a developer wishes to\nswitch to test-class scoped semantics — the <code>SpringExtension</code> can\nbe configured to use a test-class scoped extension context by annotating a\ntop-level test class with\n<a href=\"SpringExtensionConfig.html#useTestClassScopedExtensionContext()\"><code>@SpringExtensionConfig(useTestClassScopedExtensionContext = true)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "自 Spring Framework 7.0 起，<code>SpringExtension</code> 已配置为使用测试方法范围的 <a href=\"#getTestInstantiationExtensionContextScope(org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.ExtensionContext)\">扩展上下文</a>（test-method scoped <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ExtensionContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ExtensionContext</code></a>），从而为 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/Nested.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api\"><code>@Nested</code></a> 测试类层次结构中的当前测试方法，实现与 <a href=\"../../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 中字段和构造函数的依赖注入的一致性。然而，如果第三方 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.platform.launcher/org/junit/platform/launcher/TestExecutionListener.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.platform.launcher\"><code>TestExecutionListener</code></a> 与测试方法范围的扩展上下文语义不兼容，或者开发人员希望切换到测试类范围的语义，则可以通过在顶层测试类上添加 <a href=\"SpringExtensionConfig.html#useTestClassScopedExtensionContext()\"><code>@SpringExtensionConfig(useTestClassScopedExtensionContext = true)</code></a> 注解，将 <code>SpringExtension</code> 配置为使用测试类范围的扩展上下文。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>WARNING</strong>: If a test class <code>Constructor</code> is annotated\nwith <code>@Autowired</code> or automatically autowirable (see\n<a href=\"../../TestConstructor.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>@TestConstructor</code></a>),\nSpring will assume the responsibility for resolving all parameters in the\nconstructor. Consequently, no other registered <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ParameterResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ParameterResolver</code></a>\nwill be able to resolve parameters.",
      "translation": "<strong>警告</strong>：如果测试类 <code>Constructor</code> 被标注了 <code>@Autowired</code> 或自动可注入（参见 <a href=\"../../TestConstructor.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.test.context\"><code>@TestConstructor</code></a>），Spring 将负责解析构造函数中的所有参数。因此，其他已注册的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ParameterResolver.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ParameterResolver</code></a> 将无法解析参数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "To use this extension, annotate a JUnit Jupiter based test class with\n<code>@ExtendWith(SpringExtension.class)</code>, <code>@SpringJUnitConfig</code>,\n<code>@SpringJUnitWebConfig</code>, or any other annotation that is meta-annotated\nwith <code>@ExtendWith(SpringExtension.class)</code> such as <code>@SpringBootTest</code>,\netc.",
      "translation": "要使用此扩展，请使用 `<code>@ExtendWith(SpringExtension.class)</code>`、`<code>@SpringJUnitConfig</code>`、`<code>@SpringJUnitWebConfig</code>` 或任何其他带有 `<code>@ExtendWith(SpringExtension.class)</code>` 元注解（例如 `<code>@SpringBootTest</code>` 等）的注解来标注基于 JUnit Jupiter 的测试类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>WARNING</strong>: Invoking this method ensures that the\ncorresponding <code>ApplicationContext</code> is\n<a href=\"../../TestContext.html#getApplicationContext()\">loaded</a>. Consequently, this method should not be used if eager loading of\nthe application context is undesired. For example,\n<a href=\"#supportsParameter(org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.ParameterContext,org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.ExtensionContext)\"><code>supportsParameter(ParameterContext, ExtensionContext)</code></a> intentionally\ndoes not invoke this method, since doing so would potentially load an\napplication context too early or unnecessarily.",
      "translation": "<strong>警告</strong>：调用此方法会确保对应的 <code>ApplicationContext</code> 被<a href=\"../../TestContext.html#getApplicationContext()\">加载</a>。因此，如果不想急切加载应用程序上下文，则不应使用此方法。例如，<a href=\"#supportsParameter(org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.ParameterContext,org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.ExtensionContext)\"><code>supportsParameter(ParameterContext, ExtensionContext)</code></a> 故意不调用此方法，因为这样做可能会过早或无需地加载应用程序上下文。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<strong>NOTE</strong>: As of Spring Framework 7.0, the supplied\n<code>ExtensionContext</code> may not be properly <em>scoped</em>. See the\n<a href=\"SpringExtension.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit.jupiter\">class-level Javadoc</a> for further details.",
      "translation": "<strong>注意</strong>：自 Spring Framework 7.0 起，提供的<code>ExtensionContext</code>可能无法正确设置作用域。有关详细信息，请参阅<a href=\"SpringExtension.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit.jupiter\">类级别 Javadoc</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This can be effectively overridden by annotating a test class with\n<code>@SpringExtensionConfig(useTestClassScopedExtensionContext = true)</code>.\nSee the <a href=\"SpringExtension.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit.jupiter\">class-level Javadoc</a> for further details.",
      "translation": "这可以通过使用 `<code>@SpringExtensionConfig(useTestClassScopedExtensionContext = true)</code>` 注解测试类来有效覆盖。有关详细信息，请参阅 <a href=\"SpringExtension.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.test.context.junit.jupiter\">类级 Javadoc</a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method also validates that test methods and test lifecycle methods\nare not annotated with <a href=\"../../../../beans/factory/annotation/Autowired.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>@Autowired</code></a>.",
      "translation": "此方法还会验证测试方法和测试生命周期方法未使用 `<a href=\"../../../../beans/factory/annotation/Autowired.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.beans.factory.annotation\"><code>@Autowired</code></a>` 注解。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "This method does not <a href=\"#getApplicationContext(org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.ExtensionContext)\">load</a> the <code>ApplicationContext</code> or verify that the application context\nactually contains a matching candidate bean, since doing so would potentially\nload an application context too early or unnecessarily.",
      "translation": "此方法不会<a href=\"#getApplicationContext(org.junit.jupiter.api.extension.ExtensionContext)\">加载</a><code>ApplicationContext</code>，也不会验证应用程序上下文是否实际包含匹配的候选 Bean，因为这样做可能会过早或无需地加载应用程序上下文。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Delegates to <a href=\"../../../../beans/factory/annotation/ParameterResolutionDelegate.html#resolveDependency(java.lang.reflect.Parameter,int,java.lang.Class,org.springframework.beans.factory.config.AutowireCapableBeanFactory)\"><code>ParameterResolutionDelegate.resolveDependency(Parameter, int, Class, AutowireCapableBeanFactory)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "委托给 <a href=\"../../../../beans/factory/annotation/ParameterResolutionDelegate.html#resolveDependency(java.lang.reflect.Parameter,int,java.lang.Class,org.springframework.beans.factory.config.AutowireCapableBeanFactory)\"><code>ParameterResolutionDelegate.resolveDependency(Parameter, int, Class, AutowireCapableBeanFactory)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "A parameter is considered to be autowirable if one of the following\nconditions is <code>true</code>.",
      "translation": "如果一个参数满足以下任一条件，则被视为可自动注入：`<code>true</code>`。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Resolve a value for the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Parameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Parameter</code></a> in the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ParameterContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ParameterContext</code></a> by\nretrieving the corresponding dependency from the test's <a href=\"../../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "通过从测试的<a href=\"../../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>检索相应的依赖项，在提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ParameterContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ParameterContext</code></a>中解决<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Parameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Parameter</code></a>的值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Determine if the value for the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Parameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Parameter</code></a> in the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ParameterContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ParameterContext</code></a>\nshould be autowired from the test's <a href=\"../../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "确定是否应从测试的<a href=\"../../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>自动注入在提供的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ParameterContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ParameterContext</code></a>中的<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Parameter.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Parameter</code></a>的值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a href=\"../../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> associated with the supplied <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ExtensionContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ExtensionContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取与提供的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ExtensionContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ExtensionContext</code></a> 关联的 <a href=\"../../../../context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
