    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ParameterContext.html#getDeclaringExecutable()\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\">declaring\nexecutable</a> is a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Constructor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Constructor</code></a> and\n<a href=\"../../support/TestConstructorUtils.html#isAutowirableConstructor(java.lang.reflect.Executable,org.springframework.test.context.support.PropertyProvider)\"><code>TestConstructorUtils.isAutowirableConstructor(Executable, PropertyProvider)</code></a>\nreturns <code>true</code>. Note that <code>isAutowirableConstructor()</code> will be\ninvoked with a fallback <a href=\"../../support/PropertyProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>PropertyProvider</code></a> that delegates its lookup\nto <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ExtensionContext.html#getConfigurationParameter(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ExtensionContext.getConfigurationParameter(String)</code></a>.",
      "translation": "声明的可执行对象（<a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ParameterContext.html#getDeclaringExecutable()\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\">declaring executable</a>）是一个 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Constructor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Constructor</code></a>，且 <a href=\"../../support/TestConstructorUtils.html#isAutowirableConstructor(java.lang.reflect.Executable,org.springframework.test.context.support.PropertyProvider)\"><code>TestConstructorUtils.isAutowirableConstructor(Executable, PropertyProvider)</code></a> 返回 <code>true</code>。请注意，<code>isAutowirableConstructor()</code> 将使用一个回退的 <a href=\"../../support/PropertyProvider.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.test.context.support\"><code>PropertyProvider</code></a> 进行调用，该回退实现将其查找委托给 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.junit.org/6.0.1/api/org.junit.jupiter.api/org/junit/jupiter/api/extension/ExtensionContext.html#getConfigurationParameter(java.lang.String)\" title=\"class or interface in org.junit.jupiter.api.extension\"><code>ExtensionContext.getConfigurationParameter(String)</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
